[00:36.54]The sea is ringed in fire from shore to shore
[00:39.32]The night is bright as any summer noon
[00:42.34]The rockets tear the dark above the bay
[00:45.40]And the water throweth back a burning moon

[00:54.85]The old ones dance who have not danced in years
[01:00.50]The young ones kiss beneath the burning sky
[01:06.78]The horn goes round, the accordion doth wail
[01:12.49]And no one on this coast tonight shall cry

[01:18.72]This is ours! This fire! This shore!
[01:21.24]This is the birthright of the northern-born!

[01:25.97]We set the sea alight tonight!
[01:28.76]We crown the water all in flame!
[01:31.66]Sær í báli! Ljós á vatni!
[01:34.72]Let the dark come — it shall not come today!
[01:39.09]Skál til sumars! Skál til ljóss!
[01:42.17]Skål to the summer that we knew!
[01:45.00]The night is bright as any noon
[01:47.90]And the fire on the water burneth true!

[02:26.56]We who live where the winter cuts the deepest
[02:31.60]We who know the dark that swalloweth the year
[02:38.29]We burn the brightest ere the summer leaveth
[02:43.52]For we alone do hold the light so dear

[02:50.14]This is ours! This fire! This shore!
[02:52.78]This is the birthright of the northern-born!

[02:57.43]We set the sea alight tonight!
[03:00.40]We crown the water all in flame!
[03:03.17]Sær í báli! Ljós á vatni!
[03:05.96]Let the dark come — it shall not come today!
[03:10.57]Skál til sumars! Skál til ljóss!
[03:13.58]Skål to the summer that we knew!
[03:16.52]The night is bright as any noon
[03:19.30]And the fire on the water burneth true!

[03:22.52]Hej! Sær í báli!
[03:24.79]Hej! Eldr á vatni!
[03:27.99]Hej! Bál við bál!
[03:30.94]Hej! Ljós! Ljós! Ljós!

[03:45.47]We set the sea alight tonight!
[03:48.30]We crown the water all in flame!
[03:51.10]Sær í báli! Ljós á vatni!
[03:54.22]Let the dark come — it shall not come today!
[03:58.70]Skál til sumars! Skál til ljóss!
[04:01.47]Skål to the summer that we knew!
[04:04.17]The night is bright as any noon
[04:07.25]And the fire on the water burneth true!

[04:17.22]ELDR Á VATNI!
